  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">数个世纪以先，沉静之</span><span class=\"GramE\">神拉奥创造</span>了一件工具以保护祂那些尚未成熟的信徒们免受下层位面的邪恶侵扰。随着时光飞逝，凡人们已经自己找到了抵抗相关威胁的方法，而圣杖也接近被人遗忘。而在近<span class=\"GramE\">几</span>世纪，<span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>拉</em></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>奥圣杖</em></span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>Croook of Rao</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">重现于</span><span class=\"GramE\">世</span>并被用于对抗巫后伊格<span class=\"GramE\">薇</span>尔伏（法师塔莎的一个别名）。虽然巫后被击败了，但伊格薇尔伏，成功地在战斗中给圣<span class=\"GramE\">杖造成</span>了伤害，她用一个隐秘的诅咒污染了圣杖——<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">作为在未来战胜圣杖的可能性。而后，圣</span><span class=\"GramE\">杖再次</span>失落于<span class=\"GramE\">世</span>。有时，<span class=\"GramE\">圣杖会再次</span>现身，但是这件著名的神器已不再是它曾是<span class=\"GramE\">之</span>物了。无论神器的持有者有没有意识到它全部的威胁，都很少会冒险使用<span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>拉</em></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>奥圣杖</em></span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>Croook of Rao</em></span>——<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">说不定就会是最后一次。</span><br><br><em><strong>随机属性</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。这件神器具有以下随机属性，你可以通过对着<em>《地下城主指南》</em>中的</span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>“神器”</em></span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">章节掷</span><span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>以决定它们。</p><ul><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">两项弱效增益属性</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">一项强效增益属性</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">一项弱效减益属性</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br><em><strong>法术。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">圣</span><span class=\"GramE\">杖拥有</span>6<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能。当你持握它时，可以用一个动作消耗</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发或更多充能施展下列法术（豁免</span>DC18<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">）：<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.9WDd3gopYOGyYnrT]{生命灵光Aura of Life}</em>（</span>2<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">充能），<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.ujZGFLEqgI0L6oli]{净化灵光Aura of Purity}</em>（</span>2<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">充能），@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.lopw7wVkPoE7gbNu]{放逐术Banishment}（</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">充能），</span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.dU8oQCE5dA1qZ6TD]{希望信标Beacon of Hope}</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">（</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">充能），</span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.UBLAtJuRhRB3GokC]{群体疗伤术Mass Cure Wounds}</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">（</span>3<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">充能）。</span><span class=\"GramE\">圣杖在每天</span>黎明时恢复1d6<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发已消耗的充能。</span><br><em><strong>绝对放逐。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">当你正与圣杖同调且持握着它时，你可以花费</span>10<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">分钟以放逐你一英里内除了那些最强大的邪魔以外的任何邪魔。任何挑战等级大于等于</span>19<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">的邪魔不受影响。每个被放逐的邪魔会被送回其家园位面且在</span>100<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">年内无法再次回到</span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>拉</em></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>奥圣杖</em></span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>Croook of Rao</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">将其放逐的位面。</span><br><span class=\"GramE\"><em><strong>堕群本质</strong></em></span><em><strong>。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">每当使用</span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>拉</em></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>奥圣杖</em></span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>Croook of Rao</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">的绝对放逐能力或其最后一发充能被消耗时，</span><span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>一次下方的超界逆转表格。任何被此效果召唤而来的生物会出现在你60<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">尺内的随机一处未被占据的位置，且不受你的控制。</span><br><strong>超界逆转</strong></p><table class=\"MsoTable15List1LightAccent1\" style=\"BORDER-COLLAPSE:collapse;mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;mso-yfti-tbllook:1184\" border=\"0\"><tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:-1;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes;mso-yfti-lastfirstrow:yes\"><td style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;WIDTH:2cm;BORDER-BOTTOM:#8eaadb 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #8EAADB .5pt;mso-border-bottom-themecolor:accent1;mso-border-bottom-themetint:153\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:center;mso-yfti-cnfc:5;text-align:center\"><strong>d100</strong></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-TOP:medium none;BORDER-RIGHT:medium none;WIDTH:358.6pt;BORDER-BOTTOM:#8eaadb 1pt solid;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;BORDER-LEFT:medium none;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #8EAADB .5pt;mso-border-bottom-themecolor:accent1;mso-border-bottom-themetint:153\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:center;mso-yfti-cnfc:1;text-align:center\"><strong>效果</strong></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0\"><td style=\"WIDTH:2cm;BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:68\"><strong>1–25</strong></p></td><td style=\"WIDTH:358.6pt;BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:64\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">打开通往一个随机位面的传送门，传送门会在</span>5<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">分钟内关闭。</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1\"><td style=\"WIDTH:2cm;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:4\"><strong>26–45</strong></p></td><td style=\"WIDTH:358.6pt;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">出现</span>2d4<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.dLQiESMsfsXijD5c]{小魔鬼Imp}</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">与</span>2d4<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.bwtkdzavdNHISgp4]{夸塞魔Quasits}</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:2\"><td style=\"WIDTH:2cm;BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:68\"><strong>46–60</strong></p></td><td style=\"WIDTH:358.6pt;BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:64\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">出现</span>1d8<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.VmdyZDjqAc8vdncY]{魅魔Succubi}</span>/<span class=\"bbccolor\">梦魔incubi</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:3\"><td style=\"WIDTH:2cm;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:4\"><strong>61–70</strong></p></td><td style=\"WIDTH:358.6pt;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">出现</span>1d10<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.sLdpiuaZF8lujJQy]{猬魔Barbed devil}</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">与</span>1d10<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.6oc29m5uzzzb0pk3]{弗洛魔Vrocks}</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:4\"><td style=\"WIDTH:2cm;BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:68\"><strong>71–80</strong></p></td><td style=\"WIDTH:358.6pt;BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:64\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">出现</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">奥登罗斯</span><span class=\"GramE\">魔</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">Arcanaloth</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">，</span><span class=\"GramE\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.xvh2UOKv1bh03Gih]{夜鬼婆Night Hag}</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">，与</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.qXzMsRTHEodqO8l2]{罗刹Rakshasa}</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:5\"><td style=\"WIDTH:2cm;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:4\"><strong>81–85</strong></p></td><td style=\"WIDTH:358.6pt;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">出现</span><span class=\"GramE\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.1zzRQps9jZdLZGqI]{冰魔Ice devil}</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">与</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.egsSDYbqoLCelb0J]{六臂蛇魔Marilith}</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:6\"><td style=\"WIDTH:2cm;BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:68\"><strong>86–90</strong></p></td><td style=\"WIDTH:358.6pt;BACKGROUND:#d9e2f3;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt;mso-background-themecolor:accent1;mso-background-themetint:51\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:64\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">出现</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.uZ8NrRenwYZ4qNf6]{巴洛炎魔Balor}</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">与</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">只</span><span class=\"bbccolor\">@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.monsterspack.Actor.RCv5y7iWlfNxkinx]{深狱炼魔Pit Fiend}</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">。取决于</span>DM<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">的意愿，可以</span><span class=\"GramE\">用打开</span>一扇通往某一位大魔鬼或恶魔领主所在的传送门作为替代，传送门会在5<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;COLOR:black;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial;mso-color-alt:windowtext\">分钟内关闭。</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:7;mso-yfti-lastrow:yes\"><td style=\"WIDTH:2cm;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-yfti-cnfc:4\"><strong>91–00</strong></p></td><td style=\"WIDTH:358.6pt;PADDING-BOTTOM:0cm;PADDING-TOP:0cm;PADDING-LEFT:5.4pt;PADDING-RIGHT:5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">伊格薇尔伏的诅咒（见</span><span class=\"GramE\">伊格薇尔伏的</span>诅咒特性）</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br><span class=\"GramE\"><em><strong>伊格薇尔伏的</strong></em></span><em><strong>诅咒。</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">当圣杖最后一次用于对抗</span><span class=\"GramE\">伊格薇尔伏时</span>，巫后污染了这件神器的魔法本质。随着时光流逝，这项诅咒在圣杖之中蔓延，用狂暴的侵蚀威胁着圣杖的古老魔法。若<span class=\"GramE\">伊格薇尔伏的</span>诅咒发生，那么<span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>拉</em></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>奥圣杖</em></span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>Croook of Rao</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">，正如它最近被人所知的那样</span>——<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">会被摧毁，它的魔法本质会逆转、爆发为一个直径</span>50<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">英尺的传送门。这个传送门视作一道由</span><span class=\"GramE\">伊格薇尔伏施展</span>，永久存在<span class=\"GramE\">的</span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.bJdmgHYyhUJv8Zyc]{异界之门Gate}</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">法术。</span><span class=\"GramE\">这道异界之</span>门会在随后每一轮的先攻20<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">时，可以听见其用</span><span class=\"GramE\">伊格薇尔伏的</span>声音说出一只邪魔的名字，直到每一只被<span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>拉</em></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>奥圣杖</em></span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>Croook of Rao</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">放逐的邪魔回归。若那只邪魔仍然存在，那么它就会被从传送门中拖出。这一过程会持续</span>18<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">年，随后，传送门会变为一道永久的通往无底深渊第一层级</span><span class=\"GramE\">帕祖尼</span>亚的传送门。<br><em><strong>摧毁或修复圣杖。</strong></em><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>拉</em></span><span class=\"GramE\"><em>奥圣杖</em></span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>Croook of Rao</em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">能够被天堂山上永恒沉静</span><span class=\"GramE\">之神拉奥</span>的一滴眼泪修复或摧毁。让无感无欲<span class=\"GramE\">之神拉奥</span>流下眼泪的方法之一是让拉奥与祂那在很久以前便前往搜寻多元宇宙之天启的，他第一位信徒的精魂重聚。<span class=\"GramE\">圣杖会在</span>浸透于这位神明的眼泪之中一年又一日后溶解；若其<span class=\"GramE\">被神泪洗濯</span>30<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">日，</span><span class=\"GramE\">圣杖便会失去堕群本质</span>特性。</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
